  },
  "images": {
    "juve1897": "file:///home/user/Tierlist/tools/video-factory/work/ex-people/juve1897.png",
    "juve_tunnel": "file:///home/user/Tierlist/tools/video-factory/work/ex-people/juve_tunnel.png",
    "nottingham1900": "file:///home/user/Tierlist/tools/video-factory/work/ex-people/nottingham1900.png",
    "turin_students": "file:///home/user/Tierlist/tools/video-factory/work/ex-people/turin_students.png",
    "savage_letter": "file:///home/user/Tierlist/tools/video-factory/work/ex-people/savage_letter.png",
    "parcel_open": "file:///home/user/Tierlist/tools/video-factory/work/ex-people/parcel_open.png",
    "stadium_2011": "file:///home/user/Tierlist/tools/video-factory/work/ex-people/stadium_2011.png",
    "juve_pink2015": "file:///home/user/Tierlist/tools/video-factory/work/ex-people/juve_pink2015.png"
  },
  "lines": [
    {
      "text": "Why do Juventus wear black and white?",
      "scene": {
        "hook": true,
        "bg": "navy",
        "type": "kit",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "kit",
            "from": {
              "c1": "#ffffff",
              "stripes": "#111111"
            },
            "w": 0
          },
          {
            "type": "picture",
            "image": "juve_tunnel",
            "big": "?",
            "bigSize": 420,
            "bigY": 1300,
            "w": 4
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Well, it's all because of a football club in Nottingham.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "navy",
        "type": "statement",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "statement",
            "text": "BECAUSE OF|NOTTINGHAM",
            "hi": 1,
            "size": 150,
            "w": 0
          },
          {
            "type": "picture",
            "image": "nottingham1900",
            "label": "NOTTINGHAM, ENGLAND",
            "w": 9
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Juventus were founded in Turin, in 1897, by a group of school students.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "purple",
        "type": "years",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "years",
            "items": [
              {
                "year": "1897",
                "top": "TURIN",
                "label": "Juventus founded",
                "tick": true,
                "head": "#111111"
              }
            ],
            "w": 0
          },
          {
            "type": "picture",
            "image": "turin_students",
            "label": "TURIN · 1897",
            "w": 11
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Juventus is Latin, for youth.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "purple",
        "type": "statement",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "statement",
            "text": "JUVENTUS|= YOUTH",
            "hi": 1,
            "size": 170,
            "w": 0
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "And their first kit? Pink shirts, with a black tie.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "pink",
        "type": "kit",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "kit",
            "from": {
              "c1": "#f4a6c4",
              "tie": true
            },
            "label": "PINK + A BLACK TIE",
            "w": 0
          },
          {
            "type": "picture",
            "image": "juve1897",
            "label": "JUVENTUS · 1890s",
            "w": 8
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "But pink faded fast. By 1903, the story goes, the shirts were almost white.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "pink",
        "type": "kit",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "kit",
            "from": {
              "c1": "#f4a6c4",
              "tie": true
            },
            "fade": true,
            "label": "FADED",
            "w": 0
          },
          {
            "type": "years",
            "items": [
              {
                "year": "1903",
                "top": "TURIN",
                "label": "Time for new shirts",
                "tick": true,
                "head": "#e2384a"
              }
            ],
            "w": 5
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "So an Englishman in the team, Tom Savage, asked a friend back home to send new ones.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "teal",
        "type": "picture",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "picture",
            "image": "savage_letter",
            "label": "TOM SAVAGE",
            "w": 0
          },
          {
            "type": "route",
            "cities": [
              "TURIN",
              "NOTTINGHAM"
            ],
            "w": 10
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "His friend supported Notts County.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "navy",
        "type": "kit",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "kit",
            "from": {
              "c1": "#ffffff",
              "stripes": "#111111"
            },
            "label": "NOTTS COUNTY",
            "w": 0
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "So the parcel that arrived in Turin was full of black and white stripes.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "teal",
        "type": "route",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "route",
            "cities": [
              "NOTTINGHAM",
              "TURIN"
            ],
            "parcel": true,
            "w": 0
          },
          {
            "type": "picture",
            "image": "parcel_open",
            "w": 8
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Pink became black and white, and Juventus have worn it ever since.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "navy",
        "type": "kit",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "kit",
            "from": {
              "c1": "#f4a6c4"
            },
            "to": {
              "c1": "#ffffff",
              "stripes": "#111111"
            },
            "change": true,
            "label": "SINCE 1903",
            "w": 0
          },
          {
            "type": "picture",
            "image": "juve_tunnel",
            "w": 10
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Today, their nickname is the Bianconeri. The white-blacks.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "navy",
        "type": "statement",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "statement",
            "text": "BIANCONERI|THE WHITE-BLACKS",
            "hi": 1,
            "size": 150,
            "w": 0
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "And Notts County? Founded in 1862, they're the oldest professional club in the world.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "navy",
        "type": "years",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "years",
            "items": [
              {
                "year": "1862",
                "top": "NOTTS COUNTY",
                "label": "Founded",
                "tick": true,
                "head": "#111111"
              }
            ],
            "w": 0
          },
          {
            "type": "statement",
            "text": "THE OLDEST|PROFESSIONAL CLUB|IN THE WORLD",
            "hi": 0,
            "size": 110,
            "w": 8
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "So when Juventus opened their new stadium in 2011, guess who they invited.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "navy",
        "type": "picture",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "picture",
            "image": "stadium_2011",
            "label": "TURIN · SEPTEMBER 2011",
            "w": 0
          },
          {
            "type": "statement",
            "text": "GUESS WHO?",
            "hi": 0,
            "size": 200,
            "w": 9
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Notts County. It finished one-all, and County scored in the eighty-seventh minute.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "navy",
        "type": "kit",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "kit",
            "from": {
              "c1": "#ffffff",
              "stripes": "#111111"
            },
            "label": "NOTTS COUNTY",
            "w": 0
          },
          {
            "type": "score",
            "top": "8 SEPTEMBER 2011",
            "home": "JUVENTUS",
            "homeCol": "#ffffff",
            "homeInk": "#111",
            "away": "NOTTS COUNTY",
            "awayCol": "#111111",
            "awayInk": "#fff",
            "score": "1-1",
            "w": 4
          },
          {
            "type": "statement",
            "text": "87'|LEE HUGHES",
            "hi": 0,
            "size": 200,
            "w": 10
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "And in 2015, Juventus brought the pink back. As their away kit.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "pink",
        "type": "kit",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "kit",
            "from": {
              "c1": "#ffffff",
              "stripes": "#111111"
            },
            "to": {
              "c1": "#f4a6c4"
            },
            "change": true,
            "label": "2015/16 AWAY",
            "w": 0
          },
          {
            "type": "picture",
            "image": "juve_pink2015",
            "w": 10
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}